      "statement": "Onboarding a new ENS event type is a five-step process (ServiceNow 'ENS Event Onboarding' catalog item owned by Paul Henderson; payload/recipient-resolution definition; bi-weekly Disclosure Review Committee template approval; ~12 ENS engineering hours of configuration/testing; producer UAT and production enablement) with a 6-week SLA from complete submission to production, and requests submitted after 2026-11-20 are deferred past the year-end change freeze.",
