    {
      "id": "claim_09e9080ea1de47679819cba8e80c6dc0",
      "statement": "ENS subscriptions are created per user for a given event type with optional accountId and amount-threshold filters; ENS does not support subscribing to an individual entity (e.g. a specific paymentId) today, with entity-level subscriptions planned under initiative ENS-1120 for 2027-H1; producers with their own recipient lists may instead send directly to a named user ('producer-resolved recipients' pattern).",
      "evidence": [
