    {
      "id": "claim_adb791fad30f4818b997487488a76bb2",
      "statement": "The live Treasury (TRS) event catalog registered with ENS consists of TRS.WIRE.APPROVAL_REQUIRED, TRS.WIRE.RELEASED, TRS.WIRE.REJECTED, and TRS.WIRE.INCOMING_POSTED (produced by CBO/CDP, keyed to PPH v1 wire status transitions for RELEASED/REJECTED), plus TRS.ACH.STATUS_CHANGED and TRS.ACH.RETURN_RECEIVED (produced by CBO SPS, live since 2025-11); no event types are registered for wire network acceptance, beneficiary credit (gpi ACCC), wire returns, gpi milestones, or client-action-required states on held wires.",
      "evidence": [
        {
